  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Madagascar Start Ready National Reserve 2023</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Preparedness and preparedness involve actions, activities or measures taken that improve the ability of organizations to anticipate, act proactively, manage and respond to crises. It is a question of reinforcing the capacities which allow an anticipation or an effective and efficient answer to the situations. 
This may involve: 
- Development of operational procedures 
- Pre-signing of agreements with suppliers, partners, government authorities 
- Staff training on intervention plans 
- Partner capacity building activities 
- Development of IEC material 
- Targeting activities 
- Storage of distribution items (sandbags, hygiene kits, etc.). 
- Pre-positioning of distribution items 
All activities should be directly linked to improving the effectiveness and efficiency of contingency plans that have already been approved.</narrative>
  </description>
